From: wayondroid
Origin: own

A ColorBuffer the host cannot create fails that resource, not the
renderer. GFXSTREAM_FATAL aborted vine_kumquat when Adreno could not
back a 4x4 R8_UNORM buffer in AHB mode, and the instance never booted.

